{
  "id": "s8-reaction",
  "title": "答案的重量",
  "lines": [
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雨澄沒有立刻回答。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "advocate" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "推薦信我可以寫，作品內容也會照實說明。你需要時再找我，或請雅琳轉達。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "advocate" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "你可以早一點告訴我。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "advocate" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "是。我拖到今天才說。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "advocate" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "我現在還是很生氣。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "advocate" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "嗯。我沒要你現在原諒我。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "advocate" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "她看向窗外。雨水把對面大樓的招牌切成一格一格。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "advocate" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "……那就讓我先氣著。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "advocate" }] },

    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "所以呢？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "credit" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "我只是希望你知道，我不是什麼都沒做。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "credit" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "我知道你有做事。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "credit" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "但我今天還得謝謝你嗎？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "credit" }] },
    { "speaker": "zeng-yalin", "text": "不需要。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "credit" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "我把手壓在膝上，沒再講那幾次會議。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "credit" }] },

    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雨澄愣住了。她看了雅琳一眼，再看回我。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "confess" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "不。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "confess" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "我以為她是否定感情。她把椅子往後推。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "confess" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "推薦信、作品核准、離職文件，我還要找你處理。你現在說喜歡我，要我怎麼回？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "confess" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雅琳起身，站到桌側，但沒有擋住雨澄。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "confess" }] },
    { "speaker": "zeng-yalin", "text": "談話到這裡。後續由我單獨聯絡。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "confess" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "我還想說話，雅琳搖頭。我閉上嘴。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice5", "operator": "eq", "value": "confess" }] }
  ],
  "choices": [],
  "next": "s9-doorway"
}
